            "By storing room boundary coords, the program does not have to randomly choose coords and check whether",
            "the entity being spawned will collide with the room boundaries ",
            "The map content is decoupled from the core game logic which allows new maps to be added without changing",
            "the main code, which shows foresight and scalability"
